Package: sparky-stereo-obs
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, obs-studio (>= 1:33.0.1-dmo2+stereo3d1~), libstereo-layer1 (>= 1.23.0)
Enhances: obs-studio
Description: Stereo 3D module for OBS Studio
 With 3D active on the desktop, a new OBS profile starts with a full side by
 side canvas, left eye first, each eye at the render resolution; Enable 3D is
 the switch. The edition's OBS writes the 3D marks from that layout while it
 encodes and muxes; before a start, OBS says which mark cannot be written and
 why. The Stereo input filter takes a source in any packing of the stereo
 layer's list to full side by side, with the swap of the eyes per source.
